{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the endlessly looping world of the Internet, hunt down category data.</strong><br>After each successful hunt, absorb the <strong>data source</strong> that appears.<br>It will help restore your unstable code \u2014 or rebirth you as a new, complete form of data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might absorb content-type data like <strong>digital influencers, celebrities, or game characters</strong>,<br>or knowledge-type data such as <strong>critiques and financial info</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607480/extras/transparent_image.png?t=1743426084\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>six types of data</strong> to absorb.<br>Collect all from one category to unlock a satisfying ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the ending doesn\u2019t please you\u2026<br>You may start over and begin your data collection journey again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607480/extras/Dummy2.png?t=1743426084\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t fear the other data-beasts that charge at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your lovely companion, <strong>AI Internet</strong>, will gladly help you again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607480/extras/Dummy3.png?t=1743426084\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AI Internet will have items ready at the shop that may help you on your hunt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Never forget that AI Internet and you are here to help each other. :)</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607480?t=1743426084","background_raw":"https://store.akamai